# Applies to builds whose context is the repository root (frontend/Dockerfile).
# secrets/, .env and backups/ hold real credentials and password hashes, and a
# file copied into a layer stays in the image even if a later layer deletes it.
.git
**/node_modules/
secrets/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
backups/
test/e2e/artifacts/
test/e2e/fixtures/pebble/certs/
frontend/dist/
clients/ts/src/
clients/ts/dist/
backend/ssl/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
